---

import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import "../styles/global.css";
import IndexVideo from "../assets/IndexVideo.mp4";
import IndexImage1 from "../assets/IndexImagePlaceHolder.jpg"
import cyu from "../assets/cyu.png"
import cytech from "../assets/cytech.png"
import bordeaux from "../assets/bordeaux.jpg"
import indexImage from "../assets/indexImage.jpg"
import conf from "../assets/conference.jpg"
---

<!-- La partie du haut correspond à la partie des imports -->

<Layout title=>
  <section class="hero">
    <p>
      <img src={indexImage.src} alt="indexImage" />
      </video>
    </p>

    <a href="/dashboard" class="btn">
      Dashboard
    </a>
  </section>
  <section class ="partners">
  <img src={cyu.src} alt="CY" />
  <img src={cytech.src} alt="CY Tech" />
  <img src={bordeaux.src} alt="Université Bordeaux" />

</section>

</section>
  <section class="info">
    <h1>UPC Patent Litigation Data and Insights</h1>
    <p>
      This website offers independent insights and unaffiliated with the European Unified Patent Court (UPC).
      Our goal is to deliver comprehensive data and visual insights on litigation cases at the UPC, with a particular focus on infringement actions filed since its opening on June 1, 2023.
      The data and figures presented here are updated on a monthly basis, ensuring that users have access to the most current information (Last update: 07/03/2026)
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="chart-container">
   <img src={IndexImage1.src} alt="IndexImage1" class="chart-image" />   
  </section>

  <section class="info">
    The category “NPE (acquired patents)” refers to cases initiated by non-practicing entities using patents they acquired from other entities. 
    In contrast, “NPE (filed patents)” refers to cases where the NPE is the original assignee of the litigated patent.

  </section>
</Layout>

